Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Please contact us immediately regarding your business loan. At this time, the account is past due. As stated in our previous email, temporary modification plans are available to help you keep your account in good standing in times of financial strain. Please reach out to us as soon as possible by replying to this email or by phone via my direct line at the bottom of this email.

We look forward to hearing from you.

Thank you,

{!Case.OwnerFullName} | {!Case.OwnerTitle}

